msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_46706B49_29D8_4537_B65A_0914A867078C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your uncovering of the truth of those events that transpired so many years ago allowed me to "
"remember everything I had forgotten."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫同时，⟪k:1⟫因为你揭露了过去发生的事情，⟪k:2⟫所以我终于回想起了自己究竟是何人。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_530F73F2_8854_456F_9C0E_38F07572BA08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
