msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_67E6FE66_E9AF_49A2_BAB8_937EC9E55832"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the flaxen-haired girl would have been able to let go of her "
"yearning for her brother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果没有我……⟪k:1⟫亚麻色头发的少女，⟪k:2⟫会放弃对哥哥的爱慕。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_027B724C_BA77_45BF_A9B3_771705FE3179
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c5c44264f78e6c3b42fbf20327da3599787aeaacfb0092863ff7db53d51b560
