#: scenario9:scenario9_5DDACF64_5CAE_4C0A_AF83_AE2A26CEAE02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04b9889598c3847c1b67f934d2ac03afd0077985f247708890e110383829f86e
#. default-sha256: be00086d5683525c2898bb6f627bb39549ca354170f8df91b0e089b9cd3de914
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_5DDACF64_5CAE_4C0A_AF83_AE2A26CEAE02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But there’s more to the story than that, Michel."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫然而，⟪k:1⟫米歇尔……⟪k:2⟫这并不是，⟪k:3⟫最终的答案。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_2DFF2445_2A0A_4711_97E0_093585F56C4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86f3a30d69ba81302723cef20c75a91a85a1eb8c909fe5275dacd55b21639159
#. default-sha256: 26f322d5754b1b8c16523b523dc4d2ab1d5c9a1e22603e7b60934458cd8846e5
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_2DFF2445_2A0A_4711_97E0_093585F56C4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her identity as a saint gave her purpose in life,⟪k:1⟫while simultaneously constraining her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫同时也是，⟪k:1⟫她人生中无法摆脱的束缚。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6CB7BB40_3C95_44B3_A839_D2968D9EBE94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 267140849c025f8ba528e0a4447137af30593d8d693f43a139d13ab1d91e0155
#. default-sha256: f699c32e7d35a8b65144e5c8492d180a58fb239376caecf4ff1c80cfcffb3651
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6CB7BB40_3C95_44B3_A839_D2968D9EBE94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then she severed that part of her soul."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫全部从精神中分离出来，⟪k:1⟫给予了我。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_4A7D8E59_776D_418D_B0E3_A38433B512E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccf73ab5000e4af8bc5ac487001e4fdfeca989d23f311b48517b2260d4c816fc
#. default-sha256: ac58bbec9bc892ca82b1625e890eb512d56f7e3fc862f9db05d793921d4134ab
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4A7D8E59_776D_418D_B0E3_A38433B512E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was no longer a part of Morgana, but something entirely separate. ⟪k:1⟫However, I wasn’t "
"“me” yet, either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那一瞬间——⟪k:1⟫我已不是莫尔加娜的一部分，⟪k:2⟫而成为了别的存在。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫只是，⟪k:5⟫一开始……"
"我连存在本身都不具备。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_9D901910_C49C_454D_8E62_7EA3B52245D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d3886cebe70e883315d154469702ec3f1d922916ce061a34172052ce60a5ced
#. default-sha256: 5c5959dbc12c5caa285baaeaca349b39af21a4d42bda0cec4c4ae33ffbd1391f
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9D901910_C49C_454D_8E62_7EA3B52245D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But eventually, that dust gained a sense of self,⟪k:1⟫taking form as a human soul,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可就是这种物质，⟪k:1⟫成为了具有意识之物……变成了人的灵魂。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D103C95F_E067_4B9E_A23E_5D1E2174843E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e09cb6bc48548c8db016122eaba19c85c65dad850bb97a0b0f2b77cdf099cc77
